WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:05.638 line:0%
- DREW, COME FORWARD.

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:07.040 line:0%
- YES, CHEF.

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:09.042 line:0%
THIS IS A CHICKEN QUICHE
WITH CREMINI MUSHROOMS,

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:14.414 line:0%
BABY SPINACH,
AND FETA CHEESE.

00:00:22.988 --> 00:00:26.092
- UNBELIEVABLE.

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:29.028
WELL, DREW, I HAVE
A HUGE PROBLEM WITH THIS DISH.

00:00:29.061 --> 00:00:30.630
[dramatic thud]

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:33.800
IT'S THAT YOU HAVEN'T
MADE IT FOR ME SOONER.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.569
[upbeat music]
- THANK YOU, CHEF.

00:00:36.602 --> 00:00:38.337
- BECAUSE IF YOU HAD,
DREW, THEN I WOULD KNOW

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:41.474
HOW GOOD YOU ARE
AT COOKING FOOD THAT'S BAD.

00:00:41.507 --> 00:00:42.475
[dramatic thud,
suspenseful music]

00:00:42.508 --> 00:00:44.277
- I'M SORRY, CHEF.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:47.814
- AND WHEN I SAY, "BAD,"
I MEAN, MICHAEL JACKSON<i> BAD.</i>

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.949
[upbeat music]
- THANK YOU, CHEF.

00:00:49.982 --> 00:00:51.451
- YOU KNOW HOW HE LOOKED
REALLY, REALLY BAD

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:53.586
AT THE END OF HIS LIFE?
[dramatic thud]

00:00:53.619 --> 00:00:55.421
- CHEF, I'M SORRY.

00:00:55.454 --> 00:00:57.890
I DON'T KNOW IF YOU
LIKE THE DISH OR NOT.

00:00:57.923 --> 00:01:00.393
- YOU DON'T KNOW
IF I LIKE THE DISH OR NOT?

00:01:00.426 --> 00:01:02.228
WELL,
LET'S PUT IT THIS WAY.

00:01:02.261 --> 00:01:04.697
PACK YOUR [bleep] KNIVES,
GET OUT, YOU'RE OFF THE SHOW.

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:08.134
- SORRY, CHEF.

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:11.104
- BECAUSE YOU SHOULD
BE WORKING

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:14.307
IN THE FINEST RESTAURANT
IN THE WORLD.

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.775
[upbeat music]
- THANK YOU, CHEF.

00:01:15.808 --> 00:01:17.410
- JUST NOT ANY WORLD
THAT I LIVE IN.

00:01:17.443 --> 00:01:19.345
[dramatic thud]
- SORRY, CHEF.

00:01:19.378 --> 00:01:21.614
- BECAUSE, FRANKLY DREW,
I'M JEALOUS OF YOU.

00:01:21.647 --> 00:01:24.050
- THANK YOU, CHEF.

00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:25.485
- AND YOUR ABILITY
TO NOT GIVE A [bleep]

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:28.821
ABOUT WHAT YOU COOK.

00:01:28.854 --> 00:01:32.825
THIS IS NOT FIT
FOR HUMAN CONSUMPTION.

00:01:32.858 --> 00:01:36.729
NO, THIS SHOULD BE EATEN
BY A HIGHER LIFE-FORM

00:01:36.762 --> 00:01:40.666
WITH A MORE COMPLEX PALATE,
BUT ALSO AN ALTRUISTIC DRIVE

00:01:40.699 --> 00:01:44.103
TO SAVE HUMANITY
FROM DISHES LIKE THIS.

00:01:44.136 --> 00:01:47.073
JOKING. NOT!
YOU DESERVE TO DIE!

00:01:47.106 --> 00:01:50.076
AAH!

00:01:50.109 --> 00:01:53.312
SO YOU WON'T HAVE TO ENDURE
A LIFE IN WHICH YOU WILL

00:01:53.345 --> 00:01:58.418
NEVER EXCEED WHAT
YOU HAVE ACHIEVED HERE TODAY.

00:02:00.052 --> 00:02:01.888
[upbeat music]

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:07.894
♪ ♪

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:11.364
- THANK YOU, CHEF.

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:14.801
- IN CONCLUSION...EH.

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:17.669
[buzzer]

